msgid "Reference"
msgstr "參考"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:114
msgid "This module defines the following functions:"
msgstr "此模組定義了以下函式："

#: ../../library/threading.rst:119
msgid ""
"Return the number of :class:`Thread` objects currently alive.  The returned "
"count is equal to the length of the list returned by :func:`.enumerate`."
msgstr ""
"回傳目前存活的 :class:`Thread` 物件數量。回傳的數量等於 :func:`.enumerate` 所"
"回傳串列的長度。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:122
msgid "The function ``activeCount`` is a deprecated alias for this function."
msgstr "``activeCount`` 函式是此函式的已棄用別名。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:127
msgid ""
"Return the current :class:`Thread` object, corresponding to the caller's "
"thread of control.  If the caller's thread of control was not created "
"through the :mod:`!threading` module, a dummy thread object with limited "
"functionality is returned."
msgstr ""
"回傳目前的 :class:`Thread` 物件，即對應於呼叫端控制執行緒 (thread of "
"control) 的物件。如果呼叫端的控制執行緒並非透過 :mod:`!threading` 模組建立，"
"則會回傳一個功能有限的虛設執行緒物件 (dummy thread object)。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:132
msgid "The function ``currentThread`` is a deprecated alias for this function."
msgstr "``currentThread`` 函式是此函式的已棄用別名。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:137
msgid "Handle uncaught exception raised by :func:`Thread.run`."
msgstr "處理由 :func:`Thread.run` 引發且未被捕捉到的例外。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:139
msgid "The *args* argument has the following attributes:"
msgstr "*args* 引數有下列屬性："

#: ../../library/threading.rst:141
msgid "*exc_type*: Exception type."
msgstr "*exc_type*：例外型別。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:142
msgid "*exc_value*: Exception value, can be ``None``."
msgstr "*exc_value*：例外值，可以是 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:143
msgid "*exc_traceback*: Exception traceback, can be ``None``."
msgstr "*exc_traceback*：例外回溯 (traceback)，可以是 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:144
msgid "*thread*: Thread which raised the exception, can be ``None``."
msgstr "*thread*：引發例外的執行緒，可以是 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:146
msgid ""
"If *exc_type* is :exc:`SystemExit`, the exception is silently ignored. "
"Otherwise, the exception is printed out on :data:`sys.stderr`."
msgstr ""
"如果 *exc_type* 是 :exc:`SystemExit`，該例外會被靜默地忽略。否則，該例外會被"
"印出到 :data:`sys.stderr`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:149
msgid ""
"If  this function raises an exception, :func:`sys.excepthook` is called to "
"handle it."
msgstr "如果這個函式引發例外，則會呼叫 :func:`sys.excepthook` 來處理它。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:152
msgid ""
":func:`threading.excepthook` can be overridden to control how uncaught "
"exceptions raised by :func:`Thread.run` are handled."
msgstr ""
"可以覆寫 :func:`threading.excepthook` 來控制如何處理由 :func:`Thread.run` 引"
"發且未被捕捉到的例外。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:155
msgid ""
"Storing *exc_value* using a custom hook can create a reference cycle. It "
"should be cleared explicitly to break the reference cycle when the exception "
"is no longer needed."
msgstr ""
"使用自訂掛鉤 (hook) 儲存 *exc_value* 可能會產生參照循環。當不再需要該例外時，"
"應明確地清除它以打破參照循環。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:159
msgid ""
"Storing *thread* using a custom hook can resurrect it if it is set to an "
"object which is being finalized. Avoid storing *thread* after the custom "
"hook completes to avoid resurrecting objects."
msgstr ""
"如果 *thread* 被設為一個正在最終化的物件，使用自訂掛鉤儲存 *thread* 可能會讓"
"該物件復活。請避免在自訂掛鉤執行完畢後仍保存 *thread*，以免讓物件復活。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:164
msgid ":func:`sys.excepthook` handles uncaught exceptions."
msgstr ":func:`sys.excepthook` 處理未被捕捉到的例外。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:170
msgid ""
"Holds the original value of :func:`threading.excepthook`. It is saved so "
"that the original value can be restored in case they happen to get replaced "
"with broken or alternative objects."
msgstr ""
"保存 :func:`threading.excepthook` 的原始值。保存它是為了在它不巧被替換成損壞"
"的或其他替代物件時，能夠還原原始值。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:178
msgid ""
"Return the 'thread identifier' of the current thread.  This is a nonzero "
"integer.  Its value has no direct meaning; it is intended as a magic cookie "
"to be used e.g. to index a dictionary of thread-specific data.  Thread "
"identifiers may be recycled when a thread exits and another thread is "
"created."
msgstr ""
"回傳目前執行緒的「執行緒識別字」。這是一個非零的整數。它的值沒有直接的含義，"
"用途是作為 magic cookie，例如用來索引存放執行緒特定資料的字典。當一個執行緒結"
"束而另一個執行緒被建立時，執行緒識別字可能會被重複使用。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:189
msgid ""
"Return the native integral Thread ID of the current thread assigned by the "
"kernel. This is a non-negative integer. Its value may be used to uniquely "
"identify this particular thread system-wide (until the thread terminates, "
"after which the value may be recycled by the OS)."
msgstr ""
"回傳由核心 (kernel) 分配給目前執行緒的原生整數執行緒 ID。這是一個非負整數。它"
"的值可用於在整個系統中唯一識別此特定執行緒（直到該執行緒終止為止，之後該值可"
"能會被作業系統回收再利用）。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:198
msgid "Added support for GNU/kFreeBSD."
msgstr "新增對 GNU/kFreeBSD 的支援。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:201
msgid "Added support for Solaris."
msgstr "新增對 Solaris 的支援。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:207
msgid ""
"Return a list of all :class:`Thread` objects currently active.  The list "
"includes daemonic threads and dummy thread objects created "
"by :func:`current_thread`.  It excludes terminated threads and threads that "
"have not yet been started.  However, the main thread is always part of the "
"result, even when terminated."
msgstr ""
"回傳目前所有活躍的 :class:`Thread` 物件所組成的串列。此串列包含常駐執行緒 "
"(daemon thread)，以及由 :func:`current_thread` 建立的虛設執行緒物件。它不包含"
"已終止的執行緒和尚未啟動的執行緒。然而，主執行緒永遠會在結果之中，即使它已經"
"終止。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:216
msgid ""
"Return the main :class:`Thread` object.  In normal conditions, the main "
"thread is the thread from which the Python interpreter was started."
msgstr ""
"回傳主 :class:`Thread` 物件。在一般情況下，主執行緒就是啟動 Python 直譯器的那"
"個執行緒。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:227
msgid ""
"Set a trace function for all threads started from the :mod:`!threading` "
"module. The *func* will be passed to  :func:`sys.settrace` for each thread, "
"before its :meth:`~Thread.run` method is called."
msgstr ""
"為所有從 :mod:`!threading` 模組啟動的執行緒設定追蹤函式 (trace function)。對"
"每個執行緒而言，*func* 都會在其 :meth:`~Thread.run` 方法被呼叫之前傳"
"給 :func:`sys.settrace`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:233
msgid ""
"Set a trace function for all threads started from the :mod:`!threading` "
"module and all Python threads that are currently executing."
msgstr ""
"為所有從 :mod:`!threading` 模組啟動的執行緒，以及所有目前正在執行的 Python 執"
"行緒設定追蹤函式。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:236
msgid ""
"The *func* will be passed to  :func:`sys.settrace` for each thread, before "
"its :meth:`~Thread.run` method is called."
msgstr ""
"對每個執行緒而言，*func* 都會在其 :meth:`~Thread.run` 方法被呼叫之前傳"
"給 :func:`sys.settrace`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:247
msgid "Get the trace function as set by :func:`settrace`."
msgstr "取得由 :func:`settrace` 設定的追蹤函式。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:256
msgid ""
"Set a profile function for all threads started from the :mod:`!threading` "
"module. The *func* will be passed to  :func:`sys.setprofile` for each "
"thread, before its :meth:`~Thread.run` method is called."
msgstr ""
"為所有從 :mod:`!threading` 模組啟動的執行緒設定剖析函式 (profile function)。"
"對每個執行緒而言，*func* 都會在其 :meth:`~Thread.run` 方法被呼叫之前傳"
"給 :func:`sys.setprofile`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:262
msgid ""
"Set a profile function for all threads started from the :mod:`!threading` "
"module and all Python threads that are currently executing."
msgstr ""
"為所有從 :mod:`!threading` 模組啟動的執行緒，以及所有目前正在執行的 Python 執"
"行緒設定剖析函式。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:265
msgid ""
"The *func* will be passed to  :func:`sys.setprofile` for each thread, before "
"its :meth:`~Thread.run` method is called."
msgstr ""
"對每個執行緒而言，*func* 都會在其 :meth:`~Thread.run` 方法被呼叫之前傳"
"給 :func:`sys.setprofile`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:274
msgid "Get the profiler function as set by :func:`setprofile`."
msgstr "取得由 :func:`setprofile` 設定的剖析函式。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:281
msgid ""
"Return the thread stack size used when creating new threads.  The optional "
"*size* argument specifies the stack size to be used for subsequently created "
"threads, and must be 0 (use platform or configured default) or a positive "
"integer value of at least 32,768 (32 KiB). If *size* is not specified, 0 is "
"used.  If changing the thread stack size is unsupported, "
"a :exc:`RuntimeError` is raised.  If the specified stack size is invalid, "
"a :exc:`ValueError` is raised and the stack size is unmodified.  32 KiB is "
"currently the minimum supported stack size value to guarantee sufficient "
"stack space for the interpreter itself.  Note that some platforms may have "
"particular restrictions on values for the stack size, such as requiring a "
"minimum stack size > 32 KiB or requiring allocation in multiples of the "
"system memory page size - platform documentation should be referred to for "
"more information (4 KiB pages are common; using multiples of 4096 for the "
"stack size is the suggested approach in the absence of more specific "
"information)."
msgstr ""
"回傳建立新執行緒時所使用的執行緒堆疊大小。可選的 *size* 引數指定之後建立的執"
"行緒要使用的堆疊大小，必須是 0（使用平台或設定的預設值）或至少為 32,768 (32 "
"KiB) 的正整數值。如果未指定 *size*，則使用 0。如果不支援變更執行緒堆疊大小，"
"則會引發 :exc:`RuntimeError`。如果指定的堆疊大小無效，則會引"
"發 :exc:`ValueError`，且堆疊大小不會被修改。目前 32 KiB 是所支援的最小堆疊大"
"小，以保證直譯器本身有足夠的堆疊空間。請注意，某些平台可能對堆疊大小的值有特"
"定的限制，例如要求最小堆疊大小大於 32 KiB，或要求以系統記憶體分頁大小的倍數進"
"行配置；更多資訊應參考平台文件（4 KiB 的分頁很常見；在缺乏更具體資訊的情況"
"下，建議使用 4096 的倍數作為堆疊大小）。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:298
msgid "Unix platforms with POSIX threads support."
msgstr "支援 POSIX 執行緒的 Unix 平台。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:301
msgid "This module also defines the following constant:"
msgstr "此模組也定義了以下常數："

#: ../../library/threading.rst:305
msgid ""
"The maximum value allowed for the *timeout* parameter of blocking functions "
"(:meth:`Lock.acquire`, :meth:`RLock.acquire`, :meth:`Condition.wait`, etc.). "
"Specifying a timeout greater than this value will raise "
"an :exc:`OverflowError`."
msgstr ""
"阻塞函式"
"（:meth:`Lock.acquire`、:meth:`RLock.acquire`、:meth:`Condition.wait` 等）的 "
"*timeout* 參數所允許的最大值。指定大於此值的超時會引發 :exc:`OverflowError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:313
msgid ""
"This module defines a number of classes, which are detailed in the sections "
"below."
msgstr "此模組定義了數個類別，詳見以下各節。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:316
msgid ""
"The design of this module is loosely based on Java's threading model. "
"However, where Java makes locks and condition variables basic behavior of "
"every object, they are separate objects in Python.  Python's :class:`Thread` "
"class supports a subset of the behavior of Java's Thread class; currently, "
"there are no priorities, no thread groups, and threads cannot be destroyed, "
"stopped, suspended, resumed, or interrupted.  The static methods of Java's "
"Thread class, when implemented, are mapped to module-level functions."
msgstr ""
"此模組的設計大致上是以 Java 的執行緒模型為基礎。然而，Java 將鎖和條件變數 "
"(condition variable) 作為每個物件的基本行為，在 Python 中它們則是獨立的物件。"
"Python 的 :class:`Thread` 類別支援 Java Thread 類別行為的一個子集；目前沒有優"
"先權、沒有執行緒群組，且執行緒無法被銷毀、停止、暫停、恢復或中斷。Java "
"Thread 類別的靜態方法在有實作時，會對映到模組層級的函式。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:324
msgid "All of the methods described below are executed atomically."
msgstr "以下描述的所有方法均以最小不可分割的操作方式 (atomically) 執行。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:328
msgid "Thread-local data"
msgstr "執行緒區域資料"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:330
msgid ""
"Thread-local data is data whose values are thread specific. If you have data "
"that you want to be local to a thread, create a :class:`local` object and "
"use its attributes::"
msgstr ""
"執行緒區域資料 (thread-local data) 是其值專屬於特定執行緒的資料。如果你有想要"
"只屬於某個執行緒的資料，請建立一個 :class:`local` 物件並使用其屬性： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:334
msgid ""
">>> mydata = local()\n"
">>> mydata.number = 42\n"
">>> mydata.number\n"
"42"
msgstr ""
">>> mydata = local()\n"
">>> mydata.number = 42\n"
">>> mydata.number\n"
"42"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:339
msgid "You can also access the :class:`local`-object's dictionary::"
msgstr "你也可以存取 :class:`local` 物件的字典： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:341
msgid ""
">>> mydata.__dict__\n"
"{'number': 42}\n"
">>> mydata.__dict__.setdefault('widgets', [])\n"
"[]\n"
">>> mydata.widgets\n"
"[]"
msgstr ""
">>> mydata.__dict__\n"
"{'number': 42}\n"
">>> mydata.__dict__.setdefault('widgets', [])\n"
"[]\n"
">>> mydata.widgets\n"
"[]"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:348
msgid "If we access the data in a different thread::"
msgstr "如果我們在不同的執行緒中存取資料： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:350
msgid ""
">>> log = []\n"
">>> def f():\n"
"...     items = sorted(mydata.__dict__.items())\n"
"...     log.append(items)\n"
"...     mydata.number = 11\n"
"...     log.append(mydata.number)\n"
"\n"
">>> import threading\n"
">>> thread = threading.Thread(target=f)\n"
">>> thread.start()\n"
">>> thread.join()\n"
">>> log\n"
"[[], 11]"
msgstr ""
">>> log = []\n"
">>> def f():\n"
"...     items = sorted(mydata.__dict__.items())\n"
"...     log.append(items)\n"
"...     mydata.number = 11\n"
"...     log.append(mydata.number)\n"
"\n"
">>> import threading\n"
">>> thread = threading.Thread(target=f)\n"
">>> thread.start()\n"
">>> thread.join()\n"
">>> log\n"
"[[], 11]"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:364
msgid ""
"we get different data.  Furthermore, changes made in the other thread don't "
"affect data seen in this thread::"
msgstr ""
"會得到不同的資料。此外，在另一個執行緒中所做的變更不會影響在這個執行緒中看到"
"的資料： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:367
msgid ""
">>> mydata.number\n"
"42"
msgstr ""
">>> mydata.number\n"
"42"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:370
msgid ""
"Of course, values you get from a :class:`local` object, including "
"their :attr:`~object.__dict__` attribute, are for whatever thread was "
"current at the time the attribute was read.  For that reason, you generally "
"don't want to save these values across threads, as they apply only to the "
"thread they came from."
msgstr ""
"當然，你從 :class:`local` 物件取得的值（包括其 :attr:`~object.__dict__` 屬"
"性）都屬於讀取該屬性當下的目前執行緒。因此，你通常不會想要跨執行緒保存這些"
"值，因為它們只適用於其來源的執行緒。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:376
msgid ""
"You can create custom :class:`local` objects by subclassing "
"the :class:`local` class::"
msgstr ""
"你可以透過繼承 :class:`local` 類別來建立自訂的 :class:`local` 物件： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:379
msgid ""
">>> class MyLocal(local):\n"
"...     number = 2\n"
"...     def __init__(self, /, **kw):\n"
"...         self.__dict__.update(kw)\n"
"...     def squared(self):\n"
"...         return self.number ** 2"
msgstr ""
">>> class MyLocal(local):\n"
"...     number = 2\n"
"...     def __init__(self, /, **kw):\n"
"...         self.__dict__.update(kw)\n"
"...     def squared(self):\n"
"...         return self.number ** 2"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:386
msgid ""
"This can be useful to support default values, methods and initialization.  "
"Note that if you define an :py:meth:`~object.__init__` method, it will be "
"called each time the :class:`local` object is used in a separate thread.  "
"This is necessary to initialize each thread's dictionary."
msgstr ""
"這對於支援預設值、方法和初始化很有用。請注意，如果你定義"
"了 :py:meth:`~object.__init__` 方法，每次在不同的執行緒中使用"
"該 :class:`local` 物件時都會呼叫它。這是初始化每個執行緒的字典所必需的。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:392
msgid "Now if we create a :class:`local` object::"
msgstr "現在如果我們建立一個 :class:`local` 物件： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:394
msgid ">>> mydata = MyLocal(color='red')"
msgstr ">>> mydata = MyLocal(color='red')"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:396
msgid "we have a default number::"
msgstr "會有一個預設的數字： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:398
msgid ""
">>> mydata.number\n"
"2"
msgstr ""
">>> mydata.number\n"
"2"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:401
msgid "an initial color::"
msgstr "和一個初始顏色： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:403
msgid ""
">>> mydata.color\n"
"'red'\n"
">>> del mydata.color"
msgstr ""
">>> mydata.color\n"
"'red'\n"
">>> del mydata.color"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:407
msgid "And a method that operates on the data::"
msgstr "和一個操作資料的方法： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:409
msgid ""
">>> mydata.squared()\n"
"4"
msgstr ""
">>> mydata.squared()\n"
"4"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:412
msgid "As before, we can access the data in a separate thread::"
msgstr "和先前一樣，我們可以在另一個執行緒中存取資料： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:414
msgid ""
">>> log = []\n"
">>> thread = threading.Thread(target=f)\n"
">>> thread.start()\n"
">>> thread.join()\n"
">>> log\n"
"[[('color', 'red')], 11]"
msgstr ""
">>> log = []\n"
">>> thread = threading.Thread(target=f)\n"
">>> thread.start()\n"
">>> thread.join()\n"
">>> log\n"
"[[('color', 'red')], 11]"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:421
msgid "without affecting this thread's data::"
msgstr "而不會影響這個執行緒的資料： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:423
msgid ""
">>> mydata.number\n"
"2\n"
">>> mydata.color\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"...\n"
"AttributeError: 'MyLocal' object has no attribute 'color'"
msgstr ""
">>> mydata.number\n"
"2\n"
">>> mydata.color\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"...\n"
"AttributeError: 'MyLocal' object has no attribute 'color'"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:430
msgid ""
"Note that subclasses can define :term:`__slots__`, but they are not thread "
"local. They are shared across threads::"
msgstr ""
"請注意，子類別可以定義 :term:`__slots__`，但它們不是執行緒區域的，而是在執行"
"緒之間共享： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:433
msgid ""
">>> class MyLocal(local):\n"
"...     __slots__ = 'number'\n"
"\n"
">>> mydata = MyLocal()\n"
">>> mydata.number = 42\n"
">>> mydata.color = 'red'"
msgstr ""
">>> class MyLocal(local):\n"
"...     __slots__ = 'number'\n"
"\n"
">>> mydata = MyLocal()\n"
">>> mydata.number = 42\n"
">>> mydata.color = 'red'"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:440
msgid "So, the separate thread::"
msgstr "因此，另一個執行緒： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:442
msgid ""
">>> thread = threading.Thread(target=f)\n"
">>> thread.start()\n"
">>> thread.join()"
msgstr ""
">>> thread = threading.Thread(target=f)\n"
">>> thread.start()\n"
">>> thread.join()"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:446
msgid "affects what we see::"
msgstr "會影響我們看到的結果： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:448
msgid ""
">>> mydata.number\n"
"11"
msgstr ""
">>> mydata.number\n"
"11"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:454
msgid "A class that represents thread-local data."
msgstr "表示執行緒區域資料的類別。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:460
msgid "Thread objects"
msgstr "Thread 物件"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:462
msgid ""
"The :class:`Thread` class represents an activity that is run in a separate "
"thread of control.  There are two ways to specify the activity: by passing a "
"callable object to the constructor, or by overriding the :meth:`~Thread.run` "
"method in a subclass.  No other methods (except for the constructor) should "
"be overridden in a subclass.  In other words, *only*  override the "
"``__init__()`` and :meth:`~Thread.run` methods of this class."
msgstr ""
":class:`Thread` 類別代表在一個獨立的控制執行緒中執行的活動。有兩種方式可以指"
"定該活動：將一個可呼叫物件傳給建構函式，或在子類別中覆寫 :meth:`~Thread.run` "
"方法。子類別中不應覆寫其他任何方法（建構函式除外）。換句話說，*只*\\ 覆寫此類"
"別的 ``__init__()`` 和 :meth:`~Thread.run` 方法。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:469
msgid ""
"Once a thread object is created, its activity must be started by calling the "
"thread's :meth:`~Thread.start` method.  This invokes the :meth:`~Thread.run` "
"method in a separate thread of control."
msgstr ""
"一旦建立了執行緒物件，就必須呼叫該執行緒的 :meth:`~Thread.start` 方法來啟動其"
"活動。這會在一個獨立的控制執行緒中叫用 :meth:`~Thread.run` 方法。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:473
msgid ""
"Once the thread's activity is started, the thread is considered 'alive'. It "
"stops being alive when its :meth:`~Thread.run` method terminates -- either "
"normally, or by raising an unhandled exception.  "
"The :meth:`~Thread.is_alive` method tests whether the thread is alive."
msgstr ""
"一旦執行緒的活動啟動，該執行緒就被視為「存活 (alive)」。當它"
"的 :meth:`~Thread.run` 方法終止時（無論是正常結束，或是因為引發了未處理的例"
"外），它就不再存活。:meth:`~Thread.is_alive` 方法可以測試執行緒是否存活。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:478
msgid ""
"Other threads can call a thread's :meth:`~Thread.join` method.  This blocks "
"the calling thread until the thread whose :meth:`~Thread.join` method is "
"called is terminated."
msgstr ""
"其他執行緒可以呼叫某個執行緒的 :meth:`~Thread.join` 方法。這會阻塞呼叫端執行"
"緒，直到被呼叫 :meth:`~Thread.join` 方法的那個執行緒終止為止。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:482
msgid ""
"A thread has a name.  The name can be passed to the constructor, and read or "
"changed through the :attr:`~Thread.name` attribute."
msgstr ""
"執行緒有一個名稱。名稱可以傳給建構函式，並可透過 :attr:`~Thread.name` 屬性讀"
"取或更改。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:485
msgid ""
"If the :meth:`~Thread.run` method raises an "
"exception, :func:`threading.excepthook` is called to handle it. By "
"default, :func:`threading.excepthook` ignores silently :exc:`SystemExit`."
msgstr ""
"如果 :meth:`~Thread.run` 方法引發例外，則會呼叫 :func:`threading.excepthook` "
"來處理它。預設情況下，:func:`threading.excepthook` 會靜默地忽"
"略 :exc:`SystemExit`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:489
msgid ""
"A thread can be flagged as a \"daemon thread\".  The significance of this "
"flag is that the entire Python program exits when only daemon threads are "
"left.  The initial value is inherited from the creating thread.  The flag "
"can be set through the :attr:`~Thread.daemon` property or the *daemon* "
"constructor argument."
msgstr ""
"執行緒可以被標記為「常駐執行緒」。此旗標的意義在於，當只剩下常駐執行緒時，整"
"個 Python 程式就會結束。其初始值繼承自建立它的執行緒。此旗標可以透"
"過 :attr:`~Thread.daemon` 屬性或建構函式的 *daemon* 引數來設定。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:496
msgid ""
"Daemon threads are abruptly stopped at shutdown.  Their resources (such as "
"open files, database transactions, etc.) may not be released properly. If "
"you want your threads to stop gracefully, make them non-daemonic and use a "
"suitable signalling mechanism such as an :class:`Event`."
msgstr ""
"常駐執行緒會在關閉時被突然停止。它們的資源（例如開啟的檔案、資料庫交易等）可"
"能無法被正確地釋放。如果你希望執行緒能夠優雅地停止，請不要將它們設為常駐執行"
"緒，並使用合適的訊號機制，例如 :class:`Event`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:501
msgid ""
"There is a \"main thread\" object; this corresponds to the initial thread of "
"control in the Python program.  It is not a daemon thread."
msgstr ""
"有一個「主執行緒」物件；它對應於 Python 程式中最初的控制執行緒。它不是常駐執"
"行緒。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:504
msgid ""
"There is the possibility that \"dummy thread objects\" are created. These "
"are thread objects corresponding to \"alien threads\", which are threads of "
"control started outside the threading module, such as directly from C code.  "
"Dummy thread objects have limited functionality; they are always considered "
"alive and daemonic, and cannot be :ref:`joined <meth-thread-join>`.  They "
"are never deleted, since it is impossible to detect the termination of alien "
"threads."
msgstr ""
"有可能會建立「虛設執行緒物件」。這些是對應於「外來執行緒 (alien thread)」的執"
"行緒物件，外來執行緒是指在 threading 模組之外啟動的控制執行緒，例如直接從 C "
"程式碼啟動的執行緒。虛設執行緒物件的功能有限；它們永遠被視為存活且是常駐的，"
"而且無法被 :ref:`join <meth-thread-join>`。它們永遠不會被刪除，因為無法偵測外"
"來執行緒的終止。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:515
msgid ""
"This constructor should always be called with keyword arguments.  Arguments "
"are:"
msgstr "此建構函式應一律以關鍵字引數呼叫。引數如下："

#: ../../library/threading.rst:518
msgid ""
"*group* must be ``None`` as it is reserved for future extension when "
"a :class:`!ThreadGroup` class is implemented."
msgstr ""
"*group* 必須是 ``None``，因為它是保留給未來實作 :class:`!ThreadGroup` 類別時"
"的擴充之用。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:521
msgid ""
"*target* is the callable object to be invoked by the :meth:`run` method. "
"Defaults to ``None``, meaning nothing is called."
msgstr ""
"*target* 是要被 :meth:`run` 方法叫用的可呼叫物件。預設為 ``None``，表示不呼叫"
"任何東西。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:524
msgid ""
"*name* is the thread name. By default, a unique name is constructed of the "
"form \"Thread-*N*\" where *N* is a small decimal number, or \"Thread-*N* "
"(target)\" where \"target\" is ``target.__name__`` if the *target* argument "
"is specified."
msgstr ""
"*name* 是執行緒的名稱。預設會建構一個唯一的名稱，其形式為「Thread-*N*」，其"
"中 *N* 是一個小的十進位數字；或者若有指定 *target* 引數，則形式為「Thread-"
"*N* (target)」，其中「target」是 ``target.__name__``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:529
msgid ""
"*args* is a list or tuple of arguments for the target invocation.  Defaults "
"to ``()``."
msgstr "*args* 是用於呼叫 target 的引數串列或元組。預設為 ``()``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:531
msgid ""
"*kwargs* is a dictionary of keyword arguments for the target invocation. "
"Defaults to ``{}``."
msgstr "*kwargs* 是用於呼叫 target 的關鍵字引數字典。預設為 ``{}``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:534
msgid ""
"If not ``None``, *daemon* explicitly sets whether the thread is daemonic. If "
"``None`` (the default), the daemonic property is inherited from the current "
"thread."
msgstr ""
"若不是 ``None``，*daemon* 會明確地設定該執行緒是否為常駐的。若為 ``None``\\ "
"（預設值），常駐屬性會繼承自目前的執行緒。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:538
msgid ""
"*context* is the :class:`~contextvars.Context` value to use when starting "
"the thread.  The default value is ``None`` which indicates that "
"the :data:`sys.flags.thread_inherit_context` flag controls the behaviour.  "
"If the flag is true, threads will start with a copy of the context of the "
"caller of :meth:`~Thread.start`.  If false, they will start with an empty "
"context.  To explicitly start with an empty context, pass a new instance "
"of :class:`~contextvars.Context()`.  To explicitly start with a copy of the "
"current context, pass the value from :func:`~contextvars.copy_context`. The "
"flag defaults true on free-threaded builds and false otherwise."
msgstr ""
"*context* 是啟動執行緒時要使用的 :class:`~contextvars.Context` 值。預設值為 "
"``None``，表示由 :data:`sys.flags.thread_inherit_context` 旗標控制其行為。如"
"果該旗標為 true，執行緒啟動時會帶有 :meth:`~Thread.start` 呼叫者之情境的複"
"本。如果為 false，執行緒會以空的情境啟動。若要明確地以空的情境啟動，請傳"
"入 :class:`~contextvars.Context()` 的新實例。若要明確地以目前情境的複本啟動，"
"請傳入 :func:`~contextvars.copy_context` 所回傳的值。在自由執行緒建置上此旗標"
"預設為 true，其他情況下則預設為 false。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:548
msgid ""
"If the subclass overrides the constructor, it must make sure to invoke the "
"base class constructor (``Thread.__init__()``) before doing anything else to "
"the thread."
msgstr ""
"如果子類別覆寫了建構函式，它必須確保在對執行緒做任何其他事情之前，先叫用基底"
"類別的建構函式 (``Thread.__init__()``)。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:552
msgid "Added the *daemon* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *daemon* 參數。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:555
msgid "Use the *target* name if *name* argument is omitted."
msgstr "如果省略 *name* 引數，則使用 *target* 的名稱。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:558
msgid "Added the *context* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *context* 參數。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:563
msgid "Start the thread's activity."
msgstr "啟動執行緒的活動。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:565
msgid ""
"It must be called at most once per thread object.  It arranges for the "
"object's :meth:`~Thread.run` method to be invoked in a separate thread of "
"control."
msgstr ""
"每個執行緒物件最多只能呼叫它一次。它會安排在一個獨立的控制執行緒中叫用該物件"
"的 :meth:`~Thread.run` 方法。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:569
msgid ""
"This method will raise a :exc:`RuntimeError` if called more than once on the "
"same thread object."
msgstr ""
"如果在同一個執行緒物件上呼叫此方法超過一次，將會引發 :exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:572
msgid ""
"If supported, set the operating system thread name "
"to :attr:`threading.Thread.name`. The name can be truncated depending on the "
"operating system thread name limits."
msgstr ""
"若有支援，會將作業系統的執行緒名稱設為 :attr:`threading.Thread.name`。依作業"
"系統對執行緒名稱的限制，名稱可能會被截斷。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:576
msgid "Set the operating system thread name."
msgstr "設定作業系統的執行緒名稱。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:581
msgid "Method representing the thread's activity."
msgstr "表示執行緒活動的方法。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:583
msgid ""
"You may override this method in a subclass.  The standard :meth:`run` method "
"invokes the callable object passed to the object's constructor as the "
"*target* argument, if any, with positional and keyword arguments taken from "
"the *args* and *kwargs* arguments, respectively."
msgstr ""
"你可以在子類別中覆寫此方法。標準的 :meth:`run` 方法會叫用傳給物件建構函式作"
"為 *target* 引數的可呼叫物件（如果有的話），並分別以 *args* 和 *kwargs* 引數"
"作為其位置引數和關鍵字引數。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:588
msgid ""
"Using list or tuple as the *args* argument which passed to "
"the :class:`Thread` could achieve the same effect."
msgstr ""
"使用串列或元組作為傳給 :class:`Thread` 的 *args* 引數都能達到相同的效果。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:591
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "舉例來說： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:593
msgid ""
">>> from threading import Thread\n"
">>> t = Thread(target=print, args=[1])\n"
">>> t.run()\n"
"1\n"
">>> t = Thread(target=print, args=(1,))\n"
">>> t.run()\n"
"1"
msgstr ""
">>> from threading import Thread\n"
">>> t = Thread(target=print, args=[1])\n"
">>> t.run()\n"
"1\n"
">>> t = Thread(target=print, args=(1,))\n"
">>> t.run()\n"
"1"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:605
msgid ""
"Wait until the thread terminates. This blocks the calling thread until the "
"thread whose :meth:`~Thread.join` method is called terminates -- either "
"normally or through an unhandled exception -- or until the optional timeout "
"occurs."
msgstr ""
"等待直到執行緒終止。這會阻塞呼叫端執行緒，直到被呼叫 :meth:`~Thread.join` 方"
"法的那個執行緒終止（無論是正常結束或是因未處理的例外而終止），或直到可選的超"
"時發生為止。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:610
msgid ""
"When the *timeout* argument is present and not ``None``, it should be a real "
"number specifying a timeout for the operation in seconds (or fractions "
"thereof). As :meth:`~Thread.join` always returns ``None``, you must "
"call :meth:`~Thread.is_alive` after :meth:`~Thread.join` to decide whether a "
"timeout happened -- if the thread is still alive, the :meth:`~Thread.join` "
"call timed out."
msgstr ""
"當 *timeout* 引數存在且不是 ``None`` 時，它應該是一個實數，以秒為單位（可為小"
"數）指定該操作的超時時間。由於 :meth:`~Thread.join` 總是回傳 ``None``，你必須"
"在 :meth:`~Thread.join` 之後呼叫 :meth:`~Thread.is_alive` 來判斷是否發生了超"
"時；如果執行緒仍然存活，表示 :meth:`~Thread.join` 呼叫超時了。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:617
msgid ""
"When the *timeout* argument is not present or ``None``, the operation will "
"block until the thread terminates."
msgstr "當 *timeout* 引數不存在或為 ``None`` 時，該操作會阻塞直到執行緒終止。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:620
msgid "A thread can be joined many times."
msgstr "一個執行緒可以被 join 多次。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:622
msgid ""
":meth:`~Thread.join` raises a :exc:`RuntimeError` if an attempt is made to "
"join the current thread as that would cause a deadlock. It is also an error "
"to :meth:`~Thread.join` a thread before it has been started and attempts to "
"do so raise the same exception."
msgstr ""
"如果嘗試 join 目前的執行緒，:meth:`~Thread.join` 會引發 :exc:`RuntimeError`，"
"因為這會導致死鎖 (deadlock)。在執行緒啟動之前對其進行 :meth:`~Thread.join` 也"
"是一種錯誤，嘗試這樣做會引發相同的例外。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:627
msgid ""
"If an attempt is made to join a running daemonic thread in late stages "
"of :term:`Python finalization <interpreter shutdown>` :meth:`!join` raises "
"a :exc:`PythonFinalizationError`."
msgstr ""
"如果在 :term:`Python 最終化 <interpreter shutdown>`\\ 的後期階段嘗試 join 一"
"個執行中的常駐執行緒，:meth:`!join` 會引發 :exc:`PythonFinalizationError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:633
msgid "May raise :exc:`PythonFinalizationError`."
msgstr "可能引發 :exc:`PythonFinalizationError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:635 ../../library/threading.rst:789
#: ../../library/threading.rst:899 ../../library/threading.rst:1162
msgid "Accepts any real number as *timeout*, not only integer or float."
msgstr "接受任何實數作為 *timeout*，而不只是整數或浮點數。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:640
msgid ""
"A string used for identification purposes only. It has no semantics. "
"Multiple threads may be given the same name.  The initial name is set by the "
"constructor."
msgstr ""
"僅用於識別用途的字串。它沒有語義。多個執行緒可以被賦予相同的名稱。初始名稱由"
"建構函式設定。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:644
msgid ""
"On some platforms, the thread name is set at the operating system level when "
"the thread starts, so that it is visible in task managers. This name may be "
"truncated to fit in a system-specific limit (for example, 15 bytes on Linux "
"or 63 bytes on macOS)."
msgstr ""
"在某些平台上，執行緒名稱會在執行緒啟動時於作業系統層級設定，使其可在工作管理"
"員中看到。此名稱可能會被截斷以符合系統特定的限制（例如 Linux 上為 15 個位元"
"組，macOS 上為 63 個位元組）。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:649
msgid ""
"Changes to *name* are only reflected at the OS level when the currently "
"running thread is renamed. (Setting the *name* attribute of a different "
"thread only updates the Python Thread object.)"
msgstr ""
"只有在重新命名目前正在執行的執行緒時，對 *name* 的變更才會反映到作業系統層"
"級。（設定其他執行緒的 *name* 屬性只會更新 Python 的 Thread 物件。）"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:656
msgid ""
"Deprecated getter/setter API for :attr:`~Thread.name`; use it directly as a "
"property instead."
msgstr ""
"已棄用的 :attr:`~Thread.name` getter/setter API；請改為直接將其作為屬性使用。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:663
msgid ""
"The 'thread identifier' of this thread or ``None`` if the thread has not "
"been started.  This is a nonzero integer.  See the :func:`get_ident` "
"function.  Thread identifiers may be recycled when a thread exits and "
"another thread is created.  The identifier is available even after the "
"thread has exited."
msgstr ""
"此執行緒的「執行緒識別字」，如果執行緒尚未啟動則為 ``None``。這是一個非零的整"
"數。請參閱 :func:`get_ident` 函式。當一個執行緒結束而另一個執行緒被建立時，執"
"行緒識別字可能會被重複使用。即使在執行緒結束後，該識別字仍然可以取得。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:671
msgid ""
"The Thread ID (``TID``) of this thread, as assigned by the OS (kernel). This "
"is a non-negative integer, or ``None`` if the thread has not been started. "
"See the :func:`get_native_id` function. This value may be used to uniquely "
"identify this particular thread system-wide (until the thread terminates, "
"after which the value may be recycled by the OS)."
msgstr ""
"此執行緒由作業系統（核心）分配的執行緒 ID (``TID``)。這是一個非負整數，如果執"
"行緒尚未啟動則為 ``None``。請參閱 :func:`get_native_id` 函式。此值可用於在整"
"個系統中唯一識別此特定執行緒（直到該執行緒終止為止，之後該值可能會被作業系統"
"回收再利用）。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:680
msgid ""
"Similar to Process IDs, Thread IDs are only valid (guaranteed unique system-"
"wide) from the time the thread is created until the thread has been "
"terminated."
msgstr ""
"與行程 ID 類似，執行緒 ID 只在執行緒被建立到執行緒被終止的這段期間內有效（保"
"證在整個系統中是唯一的）。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:690
msgid "Return whether the thread is alive."
msgstr "回傳執行緒是否存活。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:692
msgid ""
"This method returns ``True`` just before the :meth:`~Thread.run` method "
"starts until just after the :meth:`~Thread.run` method terminates.  The "
"module function :func:`.enumerate` returns a list of all alive threads."
msgstr ""
"此方法從 :meth:`~Thread.run` 方法開始前的那一刻起，直到 :meth:`~Thread.run` "
"方法終止後的那一刻為止，都會回傳 ``True``。模組函式 :func:`.enumerate` 會回傳"
"所有存活執行緒的串列。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:698
msgid ""
"A boolean value indicating whether this thread is a daemon thread (``True``) "
"or not (``False``).  This must be set before :meth:`~Thread.start` is "
"called, otherwise :exc:`RuntimeError` is raised.  Its initial value is "
"inherited from the creating thread; the main thread is not a daemon thread "
"and therefore all threads created in the main thread default "
"to :attr:`~Thread.daemon` = ``False``."
msgstr ""
"一個布林值，表示此執行緒是否為常駐執行緒 (``True``) 或不是 (``False``)。這必"
"須在呼叫 :meth:`~Thread.start` 之前設定，否則會引發 :exc:`RuntimeError`。其初"
"始值繼承自建立它的執行緒；主執行緒不是常駐執行緒，因此在主執行緒中建立的所有"
"執行緒預設為 :attr:`~Thread.daemon` = ``False``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:705
msgid ""
"The entire Python program exits when no alive non-daemon threads are left."
msgstr "當不再有存活的非常駐 (non-daemon) 執行緒時，整個 Python 程式就會結束。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:710
msgid ""
"Deprecated getter/setter API for :attr:`~Thread.daemon`; use it directly as "
"a property instead."
msgstr ""
"已棄用的 :attr:`~Thread.daemon` getter/setter API；請改為直接將其作為屬性使"
"用。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:719
msgid "Lock objects"
msgstr "Lock 物件"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:721
msgid ""
"A primitive lock is a synchronization primitive that is not owned by a "
"particular thread when locked.  In Python, it is currently the lowest level "
"synchronization primitive available, implemented directly by "
"the :mod:`_thread` extension module."
msgstr ""
"原語鎖 (primitive lock) 是一種同步原語 (synchronization primitive)，在鎖定時"
"不屬於特定執行緒。在 Python 中，它是目前可用的最低階同步原語，直接"
"由 :mod:`_thread` 擴充模組實作。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:726
msgid ""
"A primitive lock is in one of two states, \"locked\" or \"unlocked\". It is "
"created in the unlocked state.  It has two basic "
"methods, :meth:`~Lock.acquire` and :meth:`~Lock.release`.  When the state is "
"unlocked, :meth:`~Lock.acquire` changes the state to locked and returns "
"immediately.  When the state is locked, :meth:`~Lock.acquire` blocks until a "
"call to :meth:`~Lock.release` in another thread changes it to unlocked, then "
"the :meth:`~Lock.acquire` call resets it to locked and returns.  "
"The :meth:`~Lock.release` method should only be called in the locked state; "
"it changes the state to unlocked and returns immediately. If an attempt is "
"made to release an unlocked lock, a :exc:`RuntimeError` will be raised."
msgstr ""
"原語鎖會處於兩種狀態之一：「鎖定 (locked)」或「未鎖定 (unlocked)」，建立時會"
"處於未鎖定狀態。它有兩個基本方法 :meth:`~Lock.acquire` "
"和 :meth:`~Lock.release`。當狀態為未鎖定時，:meth:`~Lock.acquire` 會將狀態變"
"更為鎖定並立即回傳。當狀態被鎖定時，:meth:`~Lock.acquire` 會阻塞 (block)，直"
"到另一個執行緒中對 :meth:`~Lock.release` 的呼叫將其更改為未鎖定狀態，然"
"後 :meth:`~Lock.acquire` 呼叫會將其重置為鎖定並回傳。:meth:`~Lock.release` 方"
"法只能在鎖定狀態下呼叫；它將狀態更改為未鎖定並立即回傳。如果嘗試釋放未鎖定的"
"鎖，則會引發 :exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:737
msgid "Locks also support the :ref:`context management protocol <with-locks>`."
msgstr "鎖也支援\\ :ref:`情境管理協定 <with-locks>`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:739
msgid ""
"When more than one thread is blocked in :meth:`~Lock.acquire` waiting for "
"the state to turn to unlocked, only one thread proceeds when "
"a :meth:`~Lock.release` call resets the state to unlocked; which one of the "
"waiting threads proceeds is not defined, and may vary across implementations."
msgstr ""
"當多個執行緒阻塞在 :meth:`~Lock.acquire` 中等待狀態轉變為未鎖定，此時若呼"
"叫 :meth:`~Lock.release` 將狀態重置為未鎖定，則只會有一個執行緒繼續進行；哪一"
"個等待執行緒會繼續進行是未定義的，並且可能因實作而異。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:744
msgid "All methods are executed atomically."
msgstr "所有方法均以最小不可分割的操作方式 (atomically) 執行。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:749
msgid ""
"The class implementing primitive lock objects.  Once a thread has acquired a "
"lock, subsequent attempts to acquire it block, until it is released; any "
"thread may release it."
msgstr ""
"實作原語鎖物件的類別。一旦執行緒獲得了鎖，後續再嘗試獲得它就會被阻塞，直到鎖"
"被釋放；任何執行緒都可以去釋放它。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:753
msgid ""
"``Lock`` is now a class. In earlier Pythons, ``Lock`` was a factory function "
"which returned an instance of the underlying private lock type."
msgstr ""
"``Lock`` 現在是一個類別。在早期的 Python 中，``Lock`` 是一個會回傳底層私有鎖"
"型別實例的工廠函式。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:761 ../../library/threading.rst:858
msgid "Acquire a lock, blocking or non-blocking."
msgstr "阻塞或非阻塞地取得鎖。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:763
msgid ""
"When invoked with the *blocking* argument set to ``True`` (the default), "
"block until the lock is unlocked, then set it to locked and return ``True``."
msgstr ""
"當以 *blocking* 引數設為 ``True``\\ （預設值）來叫用，將會阻塞直到鎖被解鎖，"
"然後將其設為鎖定並回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:766
msgid ""
"When invoked with the *blocking* argument set to ``False``, do not block. If "
"a call with *blocking* set to ``True`` would block, return ``False`` "
"immediately; otherwise, set the lock to locked and return ``True``."
msgstr ""
"當以 *blocking* 引數設為 ``False`` 叫用則不會阻塞。如果 *blocking* 設定為 "
"``True`` 的呼叫會阻塞，則立即回傳 ``False``；否則將鎖設為鎖定並回傳 "
"``True``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:770
msgid ""
"When invoked with the *timeout* argument set to a positive value, block for "
"at most the number of seconds specified by *timeout* and as long as the lock "
"cannot be acquired.  A *timeout* argument of ``-1`` specifies an unbounded "
"wait.  It is forbidden to specify a *timeout* when *blocking* is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"當以設定為正值的 *timeout* 引數叫用時，只要持續無法取得鎖，最多會阻塞 "
"*timeout* 指定的秒數。``-1`` 的 *timeout* 引數代表無限期等待。當 *blocking* "
"為 ``False`` 時禁止指定 *timeout*。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:776
msgid ""
"The return value is ``True`` if the lock is acquired successfully, ``False`` "
"if not (for example if the *timeout* expired)."
msgstr ""
"如果成功取得鎖，則回傳值為 ``True``，否則回傳值為 ``False``\\ （例如像是 "
"*timeout* 已逾期）。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:779 ../../library/threading.rst:896
#: ../../library/threading.rst:1159
msgid "The *timeout* parameter is new."
msgstr "新的 *timeout* 參數。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:782
msgid ""
"Lock acquisition can now be interrupted by signals on POSIX if the "
"underlying threading implementation supports it."
msgstr "如果底層執行緒實作支援的話，鎖的取得現在可以被 POSIX 上的訊號中斷。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:786
msgid "Lock acquisition can now be interrupted by signals on Windows."
msgstr "現在在 Windows 上，鎖的取得可以被訊號中斷。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:795
msgid ""
"Release a lock.  This can be called from any thread, not only the thread "
"which has acquired the lock."
msgstr "釋放鎖。這可以從任何執行緒呼叫，而不是只有獲得鎖的執行緒。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:798
msgid ""
"When the lock is locked, reset it to unlocked, and return.  If any other "
"threads are blocked waiting for the lock to become unlocked, allow exactly "
"one of them to proceed."
msgstr ""
"當鎖被鎖定時，將其重置為未鎖定然後回傳。如果任何其他執行緒在等待鎖被解鎖時被"
"阻塞，只允許其中一個執行緒繼續進行。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:802
msgid "When invoked on an unlocked lock, a :exc:`RuntimeError` is raised."
msgstr "當在未鎖定的鎖上叫用時，會引發 :exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:804 ../../library/threading.rst:915
msgid "There is no return value."
msgstr "沒有回傳值。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:808
msgid "Return ``True`` if the lock is acquired."
msgstr "如果有取得了鎖，則回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:815
msgid "RLock objects"
msgstr "RLock 物件"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:817
msgid ""
"A reentrant lock is a synchronization primitive that may be acquired "
"multiple times by the same thread.  Internally, it uses the concepts of "
"\"owning thread\" and \"recursion level\" in addition to the locked/unlocked "
"state used by primitive locks.  In the locked state, some thread owns the "
"lock; in the unlocked state, no thread owns it."
msgstr ""
"可重入鎖 (reentrant lock) 是一種同步原語，同一執行緒可以多次取得它。在內部，"
"除了原語鎖使用的鎖定/未鎖定狀態之外，它還使用「所屬執行緒 (owning thread)」和"
"「遞迴等級 (recursion level)」的概念。在鎖定狀態下，某個執行緒會擁有鎖；在未"
"鎖定狀態下則沒有執行緒擁有它。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:823
msgid ""
"Threads call a lock's :meth:`~RLock.acquire` method to lock it, and "
"its :meth:`~RLock.release` method to unlock it."
msgstr ""
"執行緒呼叫鎖的 :meth:`~RLock.acquire` 方法來鎖定它，並呼叫它"
"的 :meth:`~RLock.release` 方法來解鎖它。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:828
msgid ""
"Reentrant locks support the :ref:`context management protocol <with-locks>`, "
"so it is recommended to use :keyword:`with` instead of manually "
"calling :meth:`~RLock.acquire` and :meth:`~RLock.release` to handle "
"acquiring and releasing the lock for a block of code."
msgstr ""
"可重入鎖支援\\ :ref:`情境管理協定 <with-locks>`，因此建議使"
"用 :keyword:`with` 而不是手動呼叫 :meth:`~RLock.acquire` "
"和 :meth:`~RLock.release` 來對程式碼區塊處理鎖的獲得和釋放。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:833
msgid ""
"RLock's :meth:`~RLock.acquire`/:meth:`~RLock.release` call pairs may be "
"nested, unlike Lock's :meth:`~Lock.acquire`/:meth:`~Lock.release`. Only the "
"final :meth:`~RLock.release` (the :meth:`~RLock.release` of the outermost "
"pair) resets the lock to an unlocked state and allows another thread blocked "
"in :meth:`~RLock.acquire` to proceed."
msgstr ""
"RLock 的 :meth:`~RLock.acquire`/:meth:`~RLock.release` 成對呼叫可以巢狀使用，"
"這與 Lock 的 :meth:`~Lock.acquire`/:meth:`~Lock.release` 不同。只有最後一"
"個 :meth:`~RLock.release`\\ （最外層那一對的 :meth:`~RLock.release`）會將鎖重"
"置為未鎖定狀態，並允許在 :meth:`~RLock.acquire` 中阻塞的另一個執行緒繼續進"
"行。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:839
msgid ""
":meth:`~RLock.acquire`/:meth:`~RLock.release` must be used in pairs: each "
"acquire must have a release in the thread that has acquired the lock. "
"Failing to call release as many times the lock has been acquired can lead to "
"deadlock."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~RLock.acquire`/:meth:`~RLock.release` 必須成對使用：每次獲得都必須在"
"已獲得鎖的執行緒中有一個釋放。如果鎖釋放的次數不能和取得的次數一樣的話，可能"
"會導致死鎖 (deadlock)。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:846
msgid ""
"This class implements reentrant lock objects.  A reentrant lock must be "
"released by the thread that acquired it.  Once a thread has acquired a "
"reentrant lock, the same thread may acquire it again without blocking; the "
"thread must release it once for each time it has acquired it."
msgstr ""
"此類別實作了可重入鎖物件。可重入鎖必須由獲得它的執行緒釋放。一旦一個執行緒獲"
"得了可重入鎖，同一個執行緒可以再次獲得它而不會阻塞；執行緒每次獲得它也都必須"
"釋放它一次。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:851
msgid ""
"Note that ``RLock`` is actually a factory function which returns an instance "
"of the most efficient version of the concrete RLock class that is supported "
"by the platform."
msgstr ""
"請注意，``RLock`` 實際上是一個工廠函式，它會回傳平台有支援的特定 RLock 類別的"
"最高效率版本的實例。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:862
msgid ":ref:`Using RLock as a context manager <with-locks>`"
msgstr ":ref:`將 RLock 用作為情境管理器 <with-locks>`"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:863
msgid ""
"Recommended over manual :meth:`!acquire` and :meth:`release` calls whenever "
"practical."
msgstr ""
"若是使用場景合理，和手動呼叫 :meth:`!acquire` 和 :meth:`release` 相比，會是更"
"為推薦的使用方式。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:867
msgid ""
"When invoked with the *blocking* argument set to ``True`` (the default):"
msgstr "當以 *blocking* 引數設為 ``True``\\ （預設值）來呼叫："

#: ../../library/threading.rst:869 ../../library/threading.rst:881
msgid "If no thread owns the lock, acquire the lock and return immediately."
msgstr "如果沒有執行緒擁有鎖，則獲得鎖並立即回傳。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:871
msgid ""
"If another thread owns the lock, block until we are able to acquire lock, or "
"*timeout*, if set to a positive value."
msgstr ""
"如果另一個執行緒擁有鎖，則阻塞直到能夠取得鎖，或者達到 *timeout*\\ （如果設定"
"為正值）。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:874
msgid ""
"If the same thread owns the lock, acquire the lock again, and return "
"immediately. This is the difference between :class:`Lock` and :class:`!"
"RLock`; :class:`Lock` handles this case the same as the previous, blocking "
"until the lock can be acquired."
msgstr ""
"如果同一個執行緒擁有鎖，則再次取得鎖，並立即回傳。這就是 :class:`Lock` "
"和 :class:`!RLock` 之間的差別；:class:`Lock` 處理方式與上一種情況相同，會阻塞"
"直到能夠取得鎖。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:879
msgid "When invoked with the *blocking* argument set to ``False``:"
msgstr "當以 *blocking* 引數設為 ``False`` 來呼叫："

#: ../../library/threading.rst:883
msgid "If another thread owns the lock, return immediately."
msgstr "如果另一個執行緒擁有該鎖，則立即回傳。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:885
msgid ""
"If the same thread owns the lock, acquire the lock again and return "
"immediately."
msgstr "如果同一個執行緒擁有鎖，則再次取得鎖並立即回傳。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:888
msgid ""
"In all cases, if the thread was able to acquire the lock, return ``True``. "
"If the thread was unable to acquire the lock (i.e. if not blocking or the "
"timeout was reached) return ``False``."
msgstr ""
"在所有情況下，如果執行緒能夠取得鎖則回傳 ``True``。如果執行緒無法取得鎖（即沒"
"有阻塞或已達超時限制）則回傳 ``False``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:892
msgid ""
"If called multiple times, failing to call :meth:`~RLock.release` as many "
"times may lead to deadlock. Consider using :class:`!RLock` as a context "
"manager rather than calling acquire/release directly."
msgstr ""
"如果多次呼叫，又未能呼叫相同次數的 :meth:`~RLock.release`，則可能會導致死鎖。"
"考慮將 :class:`!RLock` 作為情境管理器使用，而不是直接呼叫 acquire/release。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:905
msgid ""
"Release a lock, decrementing the recursion level.  If after the decrement it "
"is zero, reset the lock to unlocked (not owned by any thread), and if any "
"other threads are blocked waiting for the lock to become unlocked, allow "
"exactly one of them to proceed.  If after the decrement the recursion level "
"is still nonzero, the lock remains locked and owned by the calling thread."
msgstr ""
"釋放鎖並減少遞迴等級。如果被減至零，則將鎖重置為未鎖定（不屬於任何執行緒），"
"並且如果任何其他執行緒被阻塞以等待鎖變成未鎖定狀態，則僅允許其中一個執行緒繼"
"續進行。如果遞減後遞迴等級仍然非零，則鎖會保持鎖定並由呼叫它的執行緒所擁有。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:911
msgid ""
"Only call this method when the calling thread owns the lock. "
"A :exc:`RuntimeError` is raised if this method is called when the lock is "
"not acquired."
msgstr ""
"僅當呼叫的執行緒擁有鎖時才能呼叫此方法。如果在未取得鎖時呼叫此方法則會引"
"發 :exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:920 ../../library/threading.rst:1019
msgid "Return a boolean indicating whether this object is locked right now."
msgstr "回傳一個布林值，表示此物件目前是否被鎖定。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:928
msgid "Condition objects"
msgstr "Condition 物件"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:930
msgid ""
"A condition variable is always associated with some kind of lock; this can "
"be passed in or one will be created by default.  Passing one in is useful "
"when several condition variables must share the same lock.  The lock is part "
"of the condition object: you don't have to track it separately."
msgstr ""
"條件變數總是與某種鎖相關聯；這個鎖可以被傳入，或者預設會建立一個。當多個條件"
"變數必須共享同一個鎖時，傳入鎖會很有用。鎖是條件物件的一部分：你不需要另外追"
"蹤它。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:935
msgid ""
"A condition variable obeys the :ref:`context management protocol <with-"
"locks>`: using the ``with`` statement acquires the associated lock for the "
"duration of the enclosed block.  The :meth:`~Condition.acquire` "
"and :meth:`~Condition.release` methods also call the corresponding methods "
"of the associated lock."
msgstr ""
"條件變數遵循\\ :ref:`情境管理協定 <with-locks>`：使用 ``with`` 陳述式會在所包"
"含區塊執行期間取得相關聯的鎖。:meth:`~Condition.acquire` "
"和 :meth:`~Condition.release` 方法也會呼叫相關聯鎖的對應方法。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:941
msgid ""
"Other methods must be called with the associated lock held.  "
"The :meth:`~Condition.wait` method releases the lock, and then blocks until "
"another thread awakens it by calling :meth:`~Condition.notify` "
"or :meth:`~Condition.notify_all`.  Once awakened, :meth:`~Condition.wait` re-"
"acquires the lock and returns.  It is also possible to specify a timeout."
msgstr ""
"其他方法必須在持有相關聯的鎖時呼叫。:meth:`~Condition.wait` 方法會釋放鎖，然"
"後阻塞直到另一個執行緒呼叫 :meth:`~Condition.notify` "
"或 :meth:`~Condition.notify_all` 將其喚醒。一旦被喚"
"醒，:meth:`~Condition.wait` 會重新取得鎖並回傳。也可以指定超時。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:947
msgid ""
"The :meth:`~Condition.notify` method wakes up one of the threads waiting for "
"the condition variable, if any are waiting.  "
"The :meth:`~Condition.notify_all` method wakes up all threads waiting for "
"the condition variable."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~Condition.notify` 方法會喚醒其中一個正在等待該條件變數的執行緒（如果"
"有的話）。:meth:`~Condition.notify_all` 方法會喚醒所有正在等待該條件變數的執"
"行緒。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:951
msgid ""
"Note: the :meth:`~Condition.notify` and :meth:`~Condition.notify_all` "
"methods don't release the lock; this means that the thread or threads "
"awakened will not return from their :meth:`~Condition.wait` call "
"immediately, but only when the thread that called :meth:`~Condition.notify` "
"or :meth:`~Condition.notify_all` finally relinquishes ownership of the lock."
msgstr ""
"注意：:meth:`~Condition.notify` 和 :meth:`~Condition.notify_all` 方法不會釋放"
"鎖；這表示被喚醒的一個或多個執行緒不會立即從它們的 :meth:`~Condition.wait` 呼"
"叫回傳，而是要等到呼叫 :meth:`~Condition.notify` "
"或 :meth:`~Condition.notify_all` 的執行緒最終放棄鎖的所有權時才會回傳。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:957
msgid ""
"The typical programming style using condition variables uses the lock to "
"synchronize access to some shared state; threads that are interested in a "
"particular change of state call :meth:`~Condition.wait` repeatedly until "
"they see the desired state, while threads that modify the state "
"call :meth:`~Condition.notify` or :meth:`~Condition.notify_all` when they "
"change the state in such a way that it could possibly be a desired state for "
"one of the waiters.  For example, the following code is a generic producer-"
"consumer situation with unlimited buffer capacity::"
msgstr ""
"使用條件變數的典型程式設計風格，是以鎖來同步對某些共享狀態的存取；對特定狀態"
"變化感興趣的執行緒會重複呼叫 :meth:`~Condition.wait`，直到看到所需的狀態為"
"止，而修改狀態的執行緒在變更狀態後，若新的狀態可能正是某個等待者所需的狀態，"
"就會呼叫 :meth:`~Condition.notify` 或 :meth:`~Condition.notify_all`。例如，以"
"下程式碼是一個具有無限緩衝區容量的通用生產者-消費者 (producer-consumer) 情"
"境： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:966
msgid ""
"# Consume one item\n"
"with cv:\n"
"    while not an_item_is_available():\n"
"        cv.wait()\n"
"    get_an_available_item()\n"
"\n"
"# Produce one item\n"
"with cv:\n"
"    make_an_item_available()\n"
"    cv.notify()"
msgstr ""
"# 消費一個項目\n"
"with cv:\n"
"    while not an_item_is_available():\n"
"        cv.wait()\n"
"    get_an_available_item()\n"
"\n"
"# 生產一個項目\n"
"with cv:\n"
"    make_an_item_available()\n"
"    cv.notify()"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:977
msgid ""
"The ``while`` loop checking for the application's condition is necessary "
"because :meth:`~Condition.wait` can return after an arbitrary long time, and "
"the condition which prompted the :meth:`~Condition.notify` call may no "
"longer hold true.  This is inherent to multi-threaded programming.  "
"The :meth:`~Condition.wait_for` method can be used to automate the condition "
"checking, and eases the computation of timeouts::"
msgstr ""
"檢查應用程式條件的 ``while`` 迴圈是必要的，因為 :meth:`~Condition.wait` 可能"
"在任意長的時間後才回傳，而促使 :meth:`~Condition.notify` 呼叫的條件可能已不再"
"成立。這是多執行緒程式設計本身固有的特性。:meth:`~Condition.wait_for` 方法可"
"用來自動化條件檢查，並簡化超時的計算： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:984
msgid ""
"# Consume an item\n"
"with cv:\n"
"    cv.wait_for(an_item_is_available)\n"
"    get_an_available_item()"
msgstr ""
"# 消費一個項目\n"
"with cv:\n"
"    cv.wait_for(an_item_is_available)\n"
"    get_an_available_item()"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:989
msgid ""
"To choose between :meth:`~Condition.notify` "
"and :meth:`~Condition.notify_all`, consider whether one state change can be "
"interesting for only one or several waiting threads.  E.g. in a typical "
"producer-consumer situation, adding one item to the buffer only needs to "
"wake up one consumer thread."
msgstr ""
"要在 :meth:`~Condition.notify` 和 :meth:`~Condition.notify_all` 之間做選擇，"
"請考慮一次狀態變化是只對一個、還是對多個等待中的執行緒有意義。例如在典型的生"
"產者-消費者情境中，將一個項目加入緩衝區只需要喚醒一個消費者執行緒。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:997
msgid ""
"This class implements condition variable objects.  A condition variable "
"allows one or more threads to wait until they are notified by another thread."
msgstr ""
"此類別實作了條件變數物件。條件變數允許一個或多個執行緒等待，直到被另一個執行"
"緒通知為止。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1000
msgid ""
"If the *lock* argument is given and not ``None``, it must be a :class:`Lock` "
"or :class:`RLock` object, and it is used as the underlying lock.  Otherwise, "
"a new :class:`RLock` object is created and used as the underlying lock."
msgstr ""
"如果有給定 *lock* 引數且不是 ``None``，它必須是 :class:`Lock` "
"或 :class:`RLock` 物件，並會被用作底層的鎖。否則，會建立一個新"
"的 :class:`RLock` 物件並將其用作底層的鎖。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1004 ../../library/threading.rst:1134
#: ../../library/threading.rst:1183 ../../library/threading.rst:1235
#: ../../library/threading.rst:1303
msgid "changed from a factory function to a class."
msgstr "從工廠函式改為類別。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1009
msgid ""
"Acquire the underlying lock. This method calls the corresponding method on "
"the underlying lock; the return value is whatever that method returns."
msgstr ""
"取得底層的鎖。此方法會呼叫底層鎖上的對應方法；回傳值即為該方法所回傳的值。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1014
msgid ""
"Release the underlying lock. This method calls the corresponding method on "
"the underlying lock; there is no return value."
msgstr "釋放底層的鎖。此方法會呼叫底層鎖上的對應方法；沒有回傳值。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1025
msgid ""
"Wait until notified or until a timeout occurs. If the calling thread has not "
"acquired the lock when this method is called, a :exc:`RuntimeError` is "
"raised."
msgstr ""
"等待直到被通知或直到發生超時。如果呼叫此方法時，呼叫端執行緒尚未取得鎖，則會"
"引發 :exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1029
msgid ""
"This method releases the underlying lock, and then blocks until it is "
"awakened by a :meth:`notify` or :meth:`notify_all` call for the same "
"condition variable in another thread, or until the optional timeout occurs.  "
"Once awakened or timed out, it re-acquires the lock and returns."
msgstr ""
"此方法會釋放底層的鎖，然後阻塞，直到被另一個執行緒中對同一條件變數"
"的 :meth:`notify` 或 :meth:`notify_all` 呼叫喚醒，或直到可選的超時發生為止。"
"一旦被喚醒或超時，它會重新取得鎖並回傳。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1034
msgid ""
"When the *timeout* argument is present and not ``None``, it should be a real "
"number specifying a timeout for the operation in seconds (or fractions "
"thereof)."
msgstr ""
"當 *timeout* 引數存在且不是 ``None`` 時，它應該是一個實數，以秒為單位（可為小"
"數）指定該操作的超時時間。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1038
msgid ""
"When the underlying lock is an :class:`RLock`, it is not released using "
"its :meth:`release` method, since this may not actually unlock the lock when "
"it was acquired multiple times recursively.  Instead, an internal interface "
"of the :class:`RLock` class is used, which really unlocks it even when it "
"has been recursively acquired several times. Another internal interface is "
"then used to restore the recursion level when the lock is reacquired."
msgstr ""
"當底層的鎖是 :class:`RLock` 時，不會使用它的 :meth:`release` 方法來釋放它，因"
"為當它被遞迴地取得多次時，這樣做可能不會真正解鎖。取而代之的是使"
"用 :class:`RLock` 類別的一個內部介面，即使它已被遞迴地取得多次，也能真正將其"
"解鎖。接著在重新取得鎖時，會使用另一個內部介面來還原遞迴等級。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1046
msgid ""
"The return value is ``True`` unless a given *timeout* expired, in which case "
"it is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"除非給定的 *timeout* 已到期（此時回傳 ``False``），否則回傳值為 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1049 ../../library/threading.rst:1268
msgid "Previously, the method always returned ``None``."
msgstr "先前此方法總是回傳 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1054
msgid ""
"Wait until a condition evaluates to true.  *predicate* should be a callable "
"which result will be interpreted as a boolean value. A *timeout* may be "
"provided giving the maximum time to wait."
msgstr ""
"等待直到某個條件求值為 true。*predicate* 應該是一個可呼叫物件，其結果會被解讀"
"為布林值。可以提供 *timeout* 來指定最長的等待時間。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1058
msgid ""
"This utility method may call :meth:`wait` repeatedly until the predicate is "
"satisfied, or until a timeout occurs. The return value is the last return "
"value of the predicate and will evaluate to ``False`` if the method timed "
"out."
msgstr ""
"此工具方法可能會重複呼叫 :meth:`wait`，直到謂語 (predicate) 被滿足或發生超時"
"為止。回傳值是謂語最後一次的回傳值，如果方法超時，其求值結果會是 ``False``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1063
msgid ""
"Ignoring the timeout feature, calling this method is roughly equivalent to "
"writing::"
msgstr "若忽略超時功能，呼叫此方法大致等同於撰寫： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1066
msgid ""
"while not predicate():\n"
"    cv.wait()"
msgstr ""
"while not predicate():\n"
"    cv.wait()"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1069
msgid ""
"Therefore, the same rules apply as with :meth:`wait`: The lock must be held "
"when called and is re-acquired on return.  The predicate is evaluated with "
"the lock held."
msgstr ""
"因此，適用與 :meth:`wait` 相同的規則：呼叫時必須持有鎖，並會在回傳時重新取得"
"鎖。謂語會在持有鎖的情況下求值。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1077
msgid ""
"By default, wake up one thread waiting on this condition, if any.  If the "
"calling thread has not acquired the lock when this method is called, "
"a :exc:`RuntimeError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，喚醒一個正在等待此條件的執行緒（如果有的話）。如果呼叫此方法時，"
"呼叫端執行緒尚未取得鎖，則會引發 :exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1081
msgid ""
"This method wakes up at most *n* of the threads waiting for the condition "
"variable; it is a no-op if no threads are waiting."
msgstr ""
"此方法最多喚醒 *n* 個正在等待該條件變數的執行緒；如果沒有執行緒在等待，則它不"
"做任何事 (no-op)。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1084
msgid ""
"The current implementation wakes up exactly *n* threads, if at least *n* "
"threads are waiting.  However, it's not safe to rely on this behavior. A "
"future, optimized implementation may occasionally wake up more than *n* "
"threads."
msgstr ""
"目前的實作在至少有 *n* 個執行緒等待時，會剛好喚醒 *n* 個執行緒。然而，依賴此"
"行為並不安全。未來經過最佳化的實作可能偶爾會喚醒超過 *n* 個執行緒。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1089
msgid ""
"Note: an awakened thread does not actually return from its :meth:`wait` call "
"until it can reacquire the lock.  Since :meth:`notify` does not release the "
"lock, its caller should."
msgstr ""
"注意：被喚醒的執行緒要等到能重新取得鎖時，才會真正從其 :meth:`wait` 呼叫回"
"傳。由於 :meth:`notify` 不會釋放鎖，因此應由其呼叫者來釋放。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1095
msgid ""
"Wake up all threads waiting on this condition.  This method acts "
"like :meth:`notify`, but wakes up all waiting threads instead of one. If the "
"calling thread has not acquired the lock when this method is called, "
"a :exc:`RuntimeError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"喚醒所有正在等待此條件的執行緒。此方法的行為與 :meth:`notify` 類似，但會喚醒"
"所有等待中的執行緒，而不是只喚醒一個。如果呼叫此方法時，呼叫端執行緒尚未取得"
"鎖，則會引發 :exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1100
msgid "The method ``notifyAll`` is a deprecated alias for this method."
msgstr "``notifyAll`` 方法是此方法的已棄用別名。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1106
msgid "Semaphore objects"
msgstr "Semaphore 物件"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1108
msgid ""
"This is one of the oldest synchronization primitives in the history of "
"computer science, invented by the early Dutch computer scientist Edsger W. "
"Dijkstra (he used the names ``P()`` and ``V()`` instead "
"of :meth:`~Semaphore.acquire` and :meth:`~Semaphore.release`)."
msgstr ""
"這是電腦科學史上最古老的同步原語之一，由早期的荷蘭電腦科學家 Edsger W. "
"Dijkstra 發明（他使用 ``P()`` 和 ``V()`` 這兩個名稱，而不"
"是 :meth:`~Semaphore.acquire` 和 :meth:`~Semaphore.release`）。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1113
msgid ""
"A semaphore manages an internal counter which is decremented by "
"each :meth:`~Semaphore.acquire` call and incremented by "
"each :meth:`~Semaphore.release` call.  The counter can never go below zero; "
"when :meth:`~Semaphore.acquire` finds that it is zero, it blocks, waiting "
"until some other thread calls :meth:`~Semaphore.release`."
msgstr ""
"號誌 (semaphore) 管理一個內部計數器，每次呼叫 :meth:`~Semaphore.acquire` 時遞"
"減，每次呼叫 :meth:`~Semaphore.release` 時遞增。計數器永遠不會低於零；"
"當 :meth:`~Semaphore.acquire` 發現它為零時，就會阻塞並等待，直到其他執行緒呼"
"叫 :meth:`~Semaphore.release` 為止。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1119
msgid ""
"Semaphores also support the :ref:`context management protocol <with-locks>`."
msgstr "號誌也支援\\ :ref:`情境管理協定 <with-locks>`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1124
msgid ""
"This class implements semaphore objects.  A semaphore manages an atomic "
"counter representing the number of :meth:`release` calls minus the number "
"of :meth:`acquire` calls, plus an initial value.  The :meth:`acquire` method "
"blocks if necessary until it can return without making the counter negative. "
"If not given, *value* defaults to 1."
msgstr ""
"此類別實作了號誌物件。號誌管理一個不可分割的 (atomic) 計數器，代"
"表 :meth:`release` 的呼叫次數減去 :meth:`acquire` 的呼叫次數，再加上一個初始"
"值。:meth:`acquire` 方法會在必要時阻塞，直到它能在不使計數器變為負值的情況下"
"回傳。若未給定，*value* 預設為 1。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1130
msgid ""
"The optional argument gives the initial *value* for the internal counter; it "
"defaults to ``1``. If the *value* given is less than 0, :exc:`ValueError` is "
"raised."
msgstr ""
"可選引數提供內部計數器的初始 *value*；預設為 ``1``。如果給定的 *value* 小於 "
"0，則會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1139
msgid "Acquire a semaphore."
msgstr "取得一個號誌。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1141
msgid "When invoked without arguments:"
msgstr "不帶引數叫用時："

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1143
msgid ""
"If the internal counter is larger than zero on entry, decrement it by one "
"and return ``True`` immediately."
msgstr "如果進入時內部計數器大於零，則將其減一並立即回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1145
msgid ""
"If the internal counter is zero on entry, block until awoken by a call "
"to :meth:`~Semaphore.release`.  Once awoken (and the counter is greater than "
"0), decrement the counter by 1 and return ``True``.  Exactly one thread will "
"be awoken by each call to :meth:`~Semaphore.release`.  The order in which "
"threads are awoken should not be relied on."
msgstr ""
"如果進入時內部計數器為零，則阻塞直到被 :meth:`~Semaphore.release` 的呼叫喚"
"醒。一旦被喚醒（且計數器大於 0），將計數器減 1 並回傳 ``True``。每次呼"
"叫 :meth:`~Semaphore.release` 都會剛好喚醒一個執行緒。不應依賴執行緒被喚醒的"
"順序。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1151
msgid ""
"When invoked with *blocking* set to ``False``, do not block.  If a call "
"without an argument would block, return ``False`` immediately; otherwise, do "
"the same thing as when called without arguments, and return ``True``."
msgstr ""
"當以 *blocking* 設為 ``False`` 叫用時，不會阻塞。如果不帶引數的呼叫會阻塞，則"
"立即回傳 ``False``；否則，執行與不帶引數呼叫時相同的動作，並回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1155
msgid ""
"When invoked with a *timeout* other than ``None``, it will block for at most "
"*timeout* seconds.  If acquire does not complete successfully in that "
"interval, return ``False``.  Return ``True`` otherwise."
msgstr ""
"當以非 ``None`` 的 *timeout* 叫用時，最多會阻塞 *timeout* 秒。如果 acquire 未"
"能在該時間區間內成功完成，則回傳 ``False``；否則回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1167
msgid ""
"Release a semaphore, incrementing the internal counter by *n*.  When it was "
"zero on entry and other threads are waiting for it to become larger than "
"zero again, wake up *n* of those threads."
msgstr ""
"釋放一個號誌，將內部計數器增加 *n*。如果進入時計數器為零，且有其他執行緒正在"
"等待它再次大於零，則喚醒其中 *n* 個執行緒。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1171
msgid "Added the *n* parameter to release multiple waiting threads at once."
msgstr "新增 *n* 參數，以一次釋放多個等待中的執行緒。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1177
msgid ""
"Class implementing bounded semaphore objects.  A bounded semaphore checks to "
"make sure its current value doesn't exceed its initial value.  If it "
"does, :exc:`ValueError` is raised. In most situations semaphores are used to "
"guard resources with limited capacity.  If the semaphore is released too "
"many times it's a sign of a bug.  If not given, *value* defaults to 1."
msgstr ""
"實作有界號誌 (bounded semaphore) 物件的類別。有界號誌會檢查以確保其目前的值不"
"會超過初始值。如果超過，則會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。在大多數情況下，號誌被用"
"來保護容量有限的資源。如果號誌被釋放太多次，就表示程式有 bug。若未給定，"
"*value* 預設為 1。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1190
msgid ":class:`Semaphore` example"
msgstr ":class:`Semaphore` 範例"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1192
msgid ""
"Semaphores are often used to guard resources with limited capacity, for "
"example, a database server.  In any situation where the size of the resource "
"is fixed, you should use a bounded semaphore.  Before spawning any worker "
"threads, your main thread would initialize the semaphore::"
msgstr ""
"號誌通常用來保護容量有限的資源，例如資料庫伺服器。在任何資源大小固定的情況"
"下，你都應該使用有界號誌。在建立任何工作執行緒之前，你的主執行緒會先初始化號"
"誌： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1197
msgid ""
"maxconnections = 5\n"
"# ...\n"
"pool_sema = BoundedSemaphore(value=maxconnections)"
msgstr ""
"maxconnections = 5\n"
"# ...\n"
"pool_sema = BoundedSemaphore(value=maxconnections)"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1201
msgid ""
"Once spawned, worker threads call the semaphore's acquire and release "
"methods when they need to connect to the server::"
msgstr ""
"工作執行緒一旦被建立，就會在需要連線到伺服器時呼叫號誌的 acquire 和 release "
"方法： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1204
msgid ""
"with pool_sema:\n"
"    conn = connectdb()\n"
"    try:\n"
"        # ... use connection ...\n"
"    finally:\n"
"        conn.close()"
msgstr ""
"with pool_sema:\n"
"    conn = connectdb()\n"
"    try:\n"
"        # ... 使用該連線 ...\n"
"    finally:\n"
"        conn.close()"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1211
msgid ""
"The use of a bounded semaphore reduces the chance that a programming error "
"which causes the semaphore to be released more than it's acquired will go "
"undetected."
msgstr ""
"使用有界號誌，可以降低「程式錯誤導致號誌的釋放次數多於取得次數」卻未被偵測到"
"的機會。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1218
msgid "Event objects"
msgstr "Event 物件"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1220
msgid ""
"This is one of the simplest mechanisms for communication between threads: "
"one thread signals an event and other threads wait for it."
msgstr ""
"這是執行緒之間最簡單的通訊機制之一：一個執行緒發出事件訊號，其他執行緒則等待"
"該事件。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1223
msgid ""
"An event object manages an internal flag that can be set to true with "
"the :meth:`~Event.set` method and reset to false with "
"the :meth:`~Event.clear` method.  The :meth:`~Event.wait` method blocks "
"until the flag is true."
msgstr ""
"事件物件管理一個內部旗標，可以使用 :meth:`~Event.set` 方法將其設為 true，並使"
"用 :meth:`~Event.clear` 方法將其重設為 false。:meth:`~Event.wait` 方法會阻塞"
"直到旗標為 true。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1230
msgid ""
"Class implementing event objects.  An event manages a flag that can be set "
"to true with the :meth:`~Event.set` method and reset to false with "
"the :meth:`clear` method.  The :meth:`wait` method blocks until the flag is "
"true. The flag is initially false."
msgstr ""
"實作事件物件的類別。事件管理一個旗標，可以使用 :meth:`~Event.set` 方法將其設"
"為 true，並使用 :meth:`clear` 方法將其重設為 false。:meth:`wait` 方法會阻塞直"
"到旗標為 true。旗標的初始值為 false。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1240
msgid "Return ``True`` if and only if the internal flag is true."
msgstr "若且唯若內部旗標為 true 時回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1242
msgid "The method ``isSet`` is a deprecated alias for this method."
msgstr "``isSet`` 方法是此方法的已棄用別名。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1246
msgid ""
"Set the internal flag to true. All threads waiting for it to become true are "
"awakened. Threads that call :meth:`wait` once the flag is true will not "
"block at all."
msgstr ""
"將內部旗標設為 true。所有等待它變為 true 的執行緒都會被喚醒。在旗標為 true 之"
"後呼叫 :meth:`wait` 的執行緒完全不會被阻塞。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1252
msgid ""
"Reset the internal flag to false. Subsequently, threads calling :meth:`wait` "
"will block until :meth:`.set` is called to set the internal flag to true "
"again."
msgstr ""
"將內部旗標重設為 false。之後，呼叫 :meth:`wait` 的執行緒會阻塞，直到呼"
"叫 :meth:`.set` 再次將內部旗標設為 true 為止。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1258
msgid ""
"Block as long as the internal flag is false and the timeout, if given, has "
"not expired. The return value represents the reason that this blocking "
"method returned; ``True`` if returning because the internal flag is set to "
"true, or ``False`` if a timeout is given and the internal flag did not "
"become true within the given wait time."
msgstr ""
"只要內部旗標為 false 且超時（若有給定）尚未到期，就持續阻塞。回傳值表示此阻塞"
"方法回傳的原因：如果是因為內部旗標被設為 true 而回傳，則為 ``True``；如果有給"
"定超時且內部旗標未在給定的等待時間內變為 true，則為 ``False``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1264
msgid ""
"When the timeout argument is present and not ``None``, it should be a real "
"number specifying a timeout for the operation in seconds, or fractions "
"thereof."
msgstr ""
"當 timeout 引數存在且不是 ``None`` 時，它應該是一個實數，以秒為單位（可為小"
"數）指定該操作的超時時間。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1275
msgid "Timer objects"
msgstr "Timer 物件"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1277
msgid ""
"This class represents an action that should be run only after a certain "
"amount of time has passed --- a timer.  :class:`Timer` is a subclass "
"of :class:`Thread` and as such also functions as an example of creating "
"custom threads."
msgstr ""
"此類別表示一個只應在經過一段時間後才執行的動作 --- 也就是計時器 "
"(timer)。:class:`Timer` 是 :class:`Thread` 的子類別，因此也可作為建立自訂執行"
"緒的範例。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1281
msgid ""
"Timers are started, as with threads, by calling their :meth:`Timer.start "
"<Thread.start>` method.  The timer can be stopped (before its action has "
"begun) by calling the :meth:`~Timer.cancel` method.  The interval the timer "
"will wait before executing its action may not be exactly the same as the "
"interval specified by the user."
msgstr ""
"計時器和執行緒一樣，是透過呼叫其 :meth:`Timer.start <Thread.start>` 方法來啟"
"動。在計時器的動作開始之前，可以呼叫 :meth:`~Timer.cancel` 方法來停止計時器。"
"計時器在執行其動作之前所等待的時間間隔，可能與使用者指定的間隔不完全相同。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1287
msgid "For example::"
msgstr "舉例來說： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1289
msgid ""
"def hello():\n"
"    print(\"hello, world\")\n"
"\n"
"t = Timer(30.0, hello)\n"
"t.start()  # after 30 seconds, \"hello, world\" will be printed"
msgstr ""
"def hello():\n"
"    print(\"hello, world\")\n"
"\n"
"t = Timer(30.0, hello)\n"
"t.start()  # 30 秒後會印出 \"hello, world\""

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1298
msgid ""
"Create a timer that will run *function* with arguments *args* and  keyword "
"arguments *kwargs*, after *interval* seconds have passed. If *args* is "
"``None`` (the default) then an empty list will be used. If *kwargs* is "
"``None`` (the default) then an empty dict will be used."
msgstr ""
"建立一個計時器，在經過 *interval* 秒之後，以引數 *args* 和關鍵字引數 "
"*kwargs* 執行 *function*。如果 *args* 為 ``None``\\ （預設值），則會使用空串"
"列。如果 *kwargs* 為 ``None``\\ （預設值），則會使用空字典。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1308
msgid ""
"Stop the timer, and cancel the execution of the timer's action.  This will "
"only work if the timer is still in its waiting stage."
msgstr ""
"停止計時器，並取消計時器動作的執行。這只有在計時器仍處於等待階段時才有效。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1313
msgid "Barrier objects"
msgstr "Barrier 物件"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1317
msgid ""
"This class provides a simple synchronization primitive for use by a fixed "
"number of threads that need to wait for each other.  Each of the threads "
"tries to pass the barrier by calling the :meth:`~Barrier.wait` method and "
"will block until all of the threads have made their :meth:`~Barrier.wait` "
"calls. At this point, the threads are released simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"此類別提供了一個簡單的同步原語，供固定數量、需要彼此等待的執行緒使用。每個執"
"行緒都會嘗試透過呼叫 :meth:`~Barrier.wait` 方法來通過屏障 (barrier)，並會阻塞"
"直到所有執行緒都已呼叫了 :meth:`~Barrier.wait`。此時，這些執行緒會同時被釋"
"放。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1323
msgid ""
"The barrier can be reused any number of times for the same number of threads."
msgstr "對於相同數量的執行緒，屏障可以被重複使用任意次數。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1325
msgid ""
"As an example, here is a simple way to synchronize a client and server "
"thread::"
msgstr "舉例來說，以下是同步用戶端與伺服器執行緒的一種簡單方式： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1327
msgid ""
"b = Barrier(2, timeout=5)\n"
"\n"
"def server():\n"
"    start_server()\n"
"    b.wait()\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        connection = accept_connection()\n"
"        process_server_connection(connection)\n"
"\n"
"def client():\n"
"    b.wait()\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        connection = make_connection()\n"
"        process_client_connection(connection)"
msgstr ""
"b = Barrier(2, timeout=5)\n"
"\n"
"def server():\n"
"    start_server()\n"
"    b.wait()\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        connection = accept_connection()\n"
"        process_server_connection(connection)\n"
"\n"
"def client():\n"
"    b.wait()\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        connection = make_connection()\n"
"        process_client_connection(connection)"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1345
msgid ""
"Create a barrier object for *parties* number of threads.  An *action*, when "
"provided, is a callable to be called by one of the threads when they are "
"released.  *timeout* is the default timeout value if none is specified for "
"the :meth:`wait` method."
msgstr ""
"為 *parties* 個執行緒建立一個屏障物件。如果有提供 *action*，它是一個可呼叫物"
"件，會在執行緒被釋放時由其中一個執行緒呼叫。*timeout* 是當 :meth:`wait` 方法"
"沒有指定超時時所使用的預設超時值。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1352
msgid ""
"Pass the barrier.  When all the threads party to the barrier have called "
"this function, they are all released simultaneously.  If a *timeout* is "
"provided, it is used in preference to any that was supplied to the class "
"constructor."
msgstr ""
"通過屏障。當參與屏障的所有執行緒都呼叫了此函式時，它們會同時全部被釋放。如果"
"有提供 *timeout*，它會優先於提供給類別建構函式的任何超時值。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1357
msgid ""
"The return value is an integer in the range 0 to *parties* -- 1, different "
"for each thread.  This can be used to select a thread to do some special "
"housekeeping, e.g.::"
msgstr ""
"回傳值是一個介於 0 到 *parties* -- 1 範圍內的整數，每個執行緒的值都不同。這可"
"以用來選出一個執行緒來做一些特殊的雜務處理，例如： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1361
msgid ""
"i = barrier.wait()\n"
"if i == 0:\n"
"    # Only one thread needs to print this\n"
"    print(\"passed the barrier\")"
msgstr ""
"i = barrier.wait()\n"
"if i == 0:\n"
"    # 只會有一個執行緒會印出這個\n"
"    print(\"passed the barrier\")"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1366
msgid ""
"If an *action* was provided to the constructor, one of the threads will have "
"called it prior to being released.  Should this call raise an error, the "
"barrier is put into the broken state."
msgstr ""
"如果有提供 *action* 給建構函式，其中一個執行緒會在被釋放之前呼叫它。如果這個"
"呼叫引發錯誤，屏障就會進入損壞狀態。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1370
msgid "If the call times out, the barrier is put into the broken state."
msgstr "如果呼叫超時，屏障就會進入損壞狀態。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1372
msgid ""
"This method may raise a :class:`BrokenBarrierError` exception if the barrier "
"is broken or reset while a thread is waiting."
msgstr ""
"如果在執行緒等待時屏障損壞或被重設，此方法可能會引"
"發 :class:`BrokenBarrierError` 例外。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1377
msgid ""
"Return the barrier to the default, empty state.  Any threads waiting on it "
"will receive the :class:`BrokenBarrierError` exception."
msgstr ""
"將屏障恢復為預設的空狀態。任何正在等待它的執行緒都會收"
"到 :class:`BrokenBarrierError` 例外。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1380
msgid ""
"Note that using this function may require some external synchronization if "
"there are other threads whose state is unknown.  If a barrier is broken it "
"may be better to just leave it and create a new one."
msgstr ""
"請注意，如果有其他執行緒的狀態未知，使用此函式可能需要一些外部同步。如果屏障"
"已損壞，直接棄置它並建立一個新的可能會比較好。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1386
msgid ""
"Put the barrier into a broken state.  This causes any active or future calls "
"to :meth:`wait` to fail with the :class:`BrokenBarrierError`.  Use this for "
"example if one of the threads needs to abort, to avoid deadlocking the "
"application."
msgstr ""
"使屏障進入損壞狀態。這會導致任何進行中或未來對 :meth:`wait` 的呼叫都"
"以 :class:`BrokenBarrierError` 失敗。例如當其中一個執行緒需要中止時，可以使用"
"此方法來避免應用程式死鎖。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1391
msgid ""
"It may be preferable to simply create the barrier with a sensible *timeout* "
"value to automatically guard against one of the threads going awry."
msgstr ""
"直接以合理的 *timeout* 值建立屏障，以自動防範其中一個執行緒出錯的情況，可能會"
"是更好的做法。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1397
msgid "The number of threads required to pass the barrier."
msgstr "通過屏障所需的執行緒數量。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1401
msgid "The number of threads currently waiting in the barrier."
msgstr "目前正在屏障中等待的執行緒數量。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1405
msgid "A boolean that is ``True`` if the barrier is in the broken state."
msgstr "一個布林值，如果屏障處於損壞狀態則為 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1410
msgid ""
"This exception, a subclass of :exc:`RuntimeError`, is raised when "
"the :class:`Barrier` object is reset or broken."
msgstr ""
"此例外是 :exc:`RuntimeError` 的子類別，會在 :class:`Barrier` 物件被重設或損壞"
"時引發。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1417
msgid ""
"Using locks, conditions, and semaphores in the :keyword:`!with` statement"
msgstr "在 :keyword:`!with` 陳述式中使用鎖、條件與號誌"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1419
msgid ""
"All of the objects provided by this module that have ``acquire`` and "
"``release`` methods can be used as context managers for a :keyword:`with` "
"statement.  The ``acquire`` method will be called when the block is entered, "
"and ``release`` will be called when the block is exited.  Hence, the "
"following snippet::"
msgstr ""
"此模組所提供、具有 ``acquire`` 和 ``release`` 方法的所有物件，都可以作"
"為 :keyword:`with` 陳述式的情境管理器使用。進入區塊時會呼叫 ``acquire`` 方"
"法，離開區塊時則會呼叫 ``release``。因此，以下程式碼片段： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1425
msgid ""
"with some_lock:\n"
"    # do something..."
msgstr ""
"with some_lock:\n"
"    # 做某些事情..."

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1428
msgid "is equivalent to::"
msgstr "等價於： ::"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1430
msgid ""
"some_lock.acquire()\n"
"try:\n"
"    # do something...\n"
"finally:\n"
"    some_lock.release()"
msgstr ""
"some_lock.acquire()\n"
"try:\n"
"    # 做某些事情...\n"
"finally:\n"
"    some_lock.release()"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1436
msgid ""
"Currently, :class:`Lock`, :class:`RLock`, :class:`Condition`, :class:`Semaphore`, "
"and :class:`BoundedSemaphore` objects may be used as :keyword:`with` "
"statement context managers."
msgstr ""
"目前 :class:`Lock`、:class:`RLock`、:class:`Condition`、:class:`Semaphore` "
"和 :class:`BoundedSemaphore` 物件都可以作為 :keyword:`with` 陳述式的情境管理"
"器使用。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1442
msgid "Iterator synchronization"
msgstr "疊代器同步"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1444
msgid ""
"By default, Python iterators do not support concurrent access. Most "
"iterators make no guarantees when accessed simultaneously from multiple "
"threads. Generator iterators, for example, raise :exc:`ValueError` if one of "
"their iterator methods is called while the generator is already executing. "
"The tools in this section allow reliable concurrency support to be added to "
"ordinary iterators and iterator-producing callables."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，Python 疊代器不支援並行存取。大多數疊代器在同時被多個執行緒存取時"
"不提供任何保證。例如，若在產生器已經在執行時呼叫產生器疊代器的某個疊代器方"
"法，就會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。本節中的工具能為一般的疊代器以及會產生疊代器"
"的可呼叫物件加入可靠的並行支援。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1451
msgid ""
"The :class:`serialize_iterator` wrapper lets multiple threads share a single "
"iterator and take turns consuming from it. While one thread is running "
"``__next__()``, the others block until the iterator becomes available. Each "
"value produced by the underlying iterator is delivered to exactly one caller."
msgstr ""
":class:`serialize_iterator` 包裝器讓多個執行緒能共享單一疊代器，並輪流從中取"
"值。當一個執行緒正在執行 ``__next__()`` 時，其他執行緒會阻塞，直到該疊代器再"
"次可用為止。底層疊代器產生的每個值都恰好只會交給一個呼叫者。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1456
msgid ""
"The :func:`concurrent_tee` function lets multiple threads each receive the "
"full stream of values from one underlying iterator. It creates independent "
"iterators that all draw from the same source. Values are buffered until "
"consumed by all of the derived iterators."
msgstr ""
":func:`concurrent_tee` 函式讓多個執行緒都能各自從同一個底層疊代器接收完整的值"
"串流。它會建立數個全都從同一個來源取值的獨立疊代器。值會被緩衝起來，直到所有"
"衍生的疊代器都取用過為止。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1463
msgid ""
"Return an iterator wrapper that serializes concurrent calls "
"to :meth:`~iterator.__next__` using a lock."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個疊代器包裝器，它使用鎖讓對 :meth:`~iterator.__next__` 的並行呼叫依序"
"逐一執行。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1466
msgid ""
"If the wrapped iterator also "
"defines :meth:`~generator.send`, :meth:`~generator.throw`, "
"or :meth:`~generator.close`, those calls are serialized as well."
msgstr ""
"如果被包裝的疊代器也定義了 :meth:`~generator.send`、:meth:`~generator.throw` "
"或 :meth:`~generator.close`，這些呼叫也同樣會依序逐一執行。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1470
msgid ""
"This makes it possible to share a single iterator, including a generator "
"iterator, between multiple threads. A lock ensures that calls are handled "
"one at a time. No values are duplicated or skipped by the wrapper itself. "
"Each item from the underlying iterator is given to exactly one caller."
msgstr ""
"這使得在多個執行緒之間共享單一疊代器（包括產生器疊代器）成為可能。鎖會確保呼"
"叫一次只處理一個。包裝器本身不會重複或跳過任何值。底層疊代器的每個項目都恰好"
"只會交給一個呼叫者。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1475
msgid ""
"This wrapper does not copy or buffer values. Threads that call :func:`next` "
"while another thread is already advancing the iterator will block until the "
"active call completes."
msgstr ""
"此包裝器不會複製或緩衝值。當另一個執行緒已經在推進疊代器時，呼"
"叫 :func:`next` 的執行緒會阻塞，直到該進行中的呼叫完成為止。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1479 ../../library/threading.rst:1516
#: ../../library/threading.rst:1567
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "舉例來說："

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1481
msgid ""
"import threading\n"
"\n"
"def squares(n):\n"
"    for x in range(n):\n"
"        yield x * x\n"
"\n"
"def consume(name, iterable):\n"
"    for item in iterable:\n"
"        print(name, item)\n"
"\n"
"source = threading.serialize_iterator(squares(5))\n"
"\n"
"t1 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"left\", source))\n"
"t2 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"right\", source))\n"
"t1.start()\n"
"t2.start()\n"
"t1.join()\n"
"t2.join()"
msgstr ""
"import threading\n"
"\n"
"def squares(n):\n"
"    for x in range(n):\n"
"        yield x * x\n"
"\n"
"def consume(name, iterable):\n"
"    for item in iterable:\n"
"        print(name, item)\n"
"\n"
"source = threading.serialize_iterator(squares(5))\n"
"\n"
"t1 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"left\", source))\n"
"t2 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"right\", source))\n"
"t1.start()\n"
"t2.start()\n"
"t1.join()\n"
"t2.join()"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1502
msgid ""
"In this example, each number is printed exactly once, but the work is shared "
"between the two threads."
msgstr "在此範例中，每個數字都只會被印出一次，但工作由兩個執行緒分擔。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1510
msgid ""
"Wrap an iterator-producing callable so that each iterator it returns is "
"automatically passed through :class:`serialize_iterator`."
msgstr ""
"包裝一個會產生疊代器的可呼叫物件，使其回傳的每個疊代器都會自動經"
"過 :class:`serialize_iterator` 包裝。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1513
msgid ""
"This is especially useful as a :term:`decorator` for generator functions, "
"allowing their generator-iterators to be consumed from multiple threads."
msgstr ""
"這特別適合作為產生器函式的\\ :term:`裝飾器 <decorator>`，讓其產生器疊代器能被"
"多個執行緒取用。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1518
msgid ""
"import threading\n"
"\n"
"@threading.synchronized_iterator\n"
"def squares(n):\n"
"    for x in range(n):\n"
"        yield x * x\n"
"\n"
"def consume(name, iterable):\n"
"    for item in iterable:\n"
"        print(name, item)\n"
"\n"
"source = squares(5)\n"
"\n"
"t1 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"left\", source))\n"
"t2 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"right\", source))\n"
"t1.start()\n"
"t2.start()\n"
"t1.join()\n"
"t2.join()"
msgstr ""
"import threading\n"
"\n"
"@threading.synchronized_iterator\n"
"def squares(n):\n"
"    for x in range(n):\n"
"        yield x * x\n"
"\n"
"def consume(name, iterable):\n"
"    for item in iterable:\n"
"        print(name, item)\n"
"\n"
"source = squares(5)\n"
"\n"
"t1 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"left\", source))\n"
"t2 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"right\", source))\n"
"t1.start()\n"
"t2.start()\n"
"t1.join()\n"
"t2.join()"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1540
msgid ""
"The returned wrapper preserves the metadata of *func*, such as its name and "
"wrapped function reference."
msgstr "回傳的包裝器會保留 *func* 的詮釋資料，例如其名稱和被包裝函式的參照。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1548
msgid ""
"Return *n* independent iterators from a single input *iterable*, with "
"guaranteed behavior when the derived iterators are consumed concurrently."
msgstr ""
"從單一輸入 *iterable* 回傳 *n* 個獨立的疊代器，並保證這些衍生疊代器在被並行取"
"用時的行為。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1551
msgid ""
"This function is similar to :func:`itertools.tee`, but is intended for cases "
"where the source iterator may feed consumers running in different threads. "
"Each returned iterator yields every value from the underlying iterable, in "
"the same order."
msgstr ""
"此函式類似於 :func:`itertools.tee`，但適用於來源疊代器可能要供應給在不同執行"
"緒中執行之消費者的情況。每個回傳的疊代器都會依相同的順序產出底層可疊代物件中"
"的每個值。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1556
msgid ""
"Internally, values are buffered until every derived iterator has consumed "
"them."
msgstr "在內部，值會被緩衝起來，直到每個衍生的疊代器都已取用過它們為止。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1559
msgid ""
"The returned iterators share the same underlying synchronization lock. Each "
"individual derived iterator is intended to be consumed by one thread at a "
"time. If a single derived iterator must itself be shared by multiple "
"threads, wrap it with :class:`serialize_iterator`."
msgstr ""
"回傳的疊代器共享同一個底層同步鎖。每個衍生的疊代器一次只應由一個執行緒取用。"
"如果單一衍生疊代器本身必須由多個執行緒共享，請以 :class:`serialize_iterator` "
"包裝它。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1564
msgid ""
"If *n* is ``0``, return an empty tuple. If *n* is negative, "
"raise :exc:`ValueError`."
msgstr ""
"如果 *n* 為 ``0``，則回傳空元組。如果 *n* 為負數，則引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1569
msgid ""
"import threading\n"
"\n"
"def squares(n):\n"
"    for x in range(n):\n"
"        yield x * x\n"
"\n"
"def consume(name, iterable):\n"
"    for item in iterable:\n"
"        print(name, item)\n"
"\n"
"source = squares(5)\n"
"left, right = threading.concurrent_tee(source)\n"
"\n"
"t1 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"left\", left))\n"
"t2 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"right\", right))\n"
"t1.start()\n"
"t2.start()\n"
"t1.join()\n"
"t2.join()"
msgstr ""
"import threading\n"
"\n"
"def squares(n):\n"
"    for x in range(n):\n"
"        yield x * x\n"
"\n"
"def consume(name, iterable):\n"
"    for item in iterable:\n"
"        print(name, item)\n"
"\n"
"source = squares(5)\n"
"left, right = threading.concurrent_tee(source)\n"
"\n"
"t1 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"left\", left))\n"
"t2 = threading.Thread(target=consume, args=(\"right\", right))\n"
"t1.start()\n"
"t2.start()\n"
"t1.join()\n"
"t2.join()"

#: ../../library/threading.rst:1591
msgid ""
"In this example, both consumer threads see the full sequence of squares from "
"a single generator expression."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，兩個消費者執行緒都會看到來自單一產生器運算式的完整平方數序列。"

